// Low-level cell access. idstd_term_idx maps (x, y) to a buffer offset; idstd_term_put and
// idstd_term_put_attr write without a bounds test, which term_set adds. lset because
// an imported list cannot be index-assigned directly.
idstd_term_idx(int idstd_x, int idstd_y) {
  int idstd_m = idstd_y * (import term_w) + idstd_x;
} return int idstd_m;
